rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "Although players may respond to the activated ability, they can\'t respond to the paying of its costs. The creature card will already be exiled by the time any player could respond."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'The Zombie creature token you put onto the battlefield will also get a +1/+1 counter.\'}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Gravecrawler’s ability doesn’t change when you could cast it.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Once you’ve cast Gravecrawler and it’s on the stack, it doesn’t matter if you lose control of the other Zombie.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If there’s only one card in your library when Tower Geist enters the battlefield, you’ll look at that card and put it into your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'When Relentless Skaabs returns to the battlefield because of its undying ability, it’s not being cast. You won’t exile a creature card from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to otherwise remove the creature card you exiled in order to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must exile exactly one creature card from your graveyard to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without exiling a creature card, and you cannot exile additional creature cards.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If you have fewer than four cards in your library, you\'ll look at all the cards there and put one into your hand and the rest into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "In most cases, when determining whether a creature entering the battlefield under your control should get a +1/+1 counter, you\'ll simply look at what the creature will looklike on the battlefield. You\'ll consider any effects affecting a creature entering the battlefield under your control."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'The effect is cumulative. Human creatures you control will enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter for each Dearly Departed in your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Untapping an attacking creature doesn\'t remove it from combat."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "You\'ll gain life equal to the creature\'s last known toughness before it died. For example, if Abattoir Ghoul deals 3 first-strike damage to a 7/7 creature and then you give the creature -5/-5 before the regular combat damage step, you\'ll gain 2 life."}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Unbreathing Horde enters the battlefield from a graveyard, it will count itself when determining how many +1/+1 counters it enters the battlefield with.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Unbreathing Horde has no +1/+1 counters on it (but its toughness is raised above 0 by another effect), any damage dealt to it will still be prevented, even though no counter will be removed.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Only one +1/+1 counter will be removed, no matter how much damage is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If you control the only Vampire, Werewolf, or Zombie, you must target it with Slayer of the Wicked’s ability. You choose whether or not to destroy the target when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'Once the enchanted creature has been declared as an attacking or blocking creature, causing it to stop being a Human won’t remove it from combat. It will lose the +2/+2 bonus, however.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain is equal to the creature’s toughness as it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Barter in Blood doesn’t target any creatures and may be cast even if a player controls fewer than two creatures.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'If a player controls only one creature, that creature is sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'The active player chooses which creatures will be sacrificed first, then each other player in turn order does the same. Then all creatures are sacrificed simultaneously.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'Mist Raven’s ability is mandatory. If Mist Raven is the only creature on the battlefield when its ability triggers, you must choose it as the target.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'The amount of life you gain is based on the number of other creatures you control when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to otherwise remove the creature card you exiled in order to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must exile exactly one creature card from your graveyard to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without exiling a creature card, and you cannot exile additional creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creatures will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creatures will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creatures will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If a creature token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If a double-faced card is exiled, it will return with its front face up.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Because you consider only the characteristics of a double-faced card’s front face while it’s not on the battlefield, the types of its back face won’t be counted for delirium.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'In some rare cases, you can have a token or a copy of a spell in your graveyard at the moment that an object’s delirium ability counts the card types among cards in your graveyard, before that token or copy ceases to exist. Because tokens and copies of spells are not cards, even if they are copies of cards, their types will never be counted.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Mindwrack Demon’s delirium triggered ability does not include an intervening “if” clause. This ability triggers at the beginning of your upkeep regardless of the number of types in your graveyard, and it checks that number as it resolves to determine whether you lose 4 life or not.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The card types in Magic are artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, land, planeswalker, sorcery, and tribal (a card type that appears on some older cards). Supertypes (such as legendary and basic) and subtypes (such as Human and Equipment) are not counted.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The number of card types matters, not the number of cards. For example, Wicker Witch (an artifact creature) along with Catalog (an instant) and Chaplain’s Blessing (a sorcery) will enable delirium.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Because you consider only the characteristics of a double-faced card’s front face while it’s not on the battlefield, the types of its back face won’t be counted for delirium.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'In some rare cases, you can have a token or a copy of a spell in your graveyard at the moment that an object’s delirium ability counts the card types among cards in your graveyard, before that token or copy ceases to exist. Because tokens and copies of spells are not cards, even if they are copies of cards, their types will never be counted.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Most triggered delirium abilities use an intervening “if” clause. There must be four or more card types among cards in your graveyard in order for these abilities to trigger, otherwise they never trigger at all. There’s no way to have the ability trigger if there aren’t enough card types, even if you intend to raise that number in response to the triggered ability. The number of card types is checked again as the trigger resolves, and if it has become too low somehow, the ability does nothing. If which card types are in your graveyard changes but the quantity of card types stays the same (or increases), then the delirium triggered ability will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The card types in Magic are artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, land, planeswalker, sorcery, and tribal (a card type that appears on some older cards). Supertypes (such as legendary and basic) and subtypes (such as Human and Equipment) are not counted.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The number of card types matters, not the number of cards. For example, Wicker Witch (an artifact creature) along with Catalog (an instant) and Chaplain’s Blessing (a sorcery) will enable delirium.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'Compelling Deterrence targets only the nonland permanent. If that permanent becomes an illegal target, Compelling Deterrence doesn’t resolve and that player doesn’t discard a card.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you target the only Zombie you control with Compelling Deterrence, you won’t discard a card.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'The card returned to its owner’s hand may be the card they discard. If it’s the only card in that player’s hand, it must be discarded.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'You choose which lands to untap after you have drawn three cards. Lands controlled by any player may be untapped this way.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "A double-faced creature only has the name of the face that\'s up. For example, if Village Ironsmith is targeted by Sever the Bloodline, Ironfang wouldn\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If the targeted creature is an illegal target by the time Sever the Bloodline resolves, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No creatures will be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Only creatures on the battlefield will be exiled. In other zones, they\'re “creature cards,” not “creatures.”"}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': \'Unless a token is a copy of another permanent or was explicitly given a name by the effect that created it, its name is the subtypes it was given when it was created plus the word "Token." For example, if an effect creates a 1/1 Soldier creature token, that token is named "Soldier Token."\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If Falkenrath Noble and another creature die at the same time, Falkenrath Noble\'s triggered ability will trigger for each of them."}]', "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If Tandem Lookout or the creature it’s paired with is dealt lethal damage at the same time that either deals damage to an opponent, its ability triggers. You’ll draw a card even though that creature no longer has the ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-17\', \'text\': \'Geist of Saint Traft is banned as a commander in Duel Commander format, but it may be part of your deck.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Although the Angel is an attacking creature, it was never declared as an attacking creature. This means that abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won\'t trigger when it enters the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Any effects that say that the Angel can\'t attack (such as that of Propaganda) affect only the declaration of attackers. They won\'t stop the Angel token from entering the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you create more than one Angel token (most likely due to Doubling Season), both are exiled at end of combat. On the other hand, if something else becomes a copy of the Angel token, the copy isn\'t exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You choose which player or planeswalker the Angel token is attacking. It doesn\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker that Geist of Saint Traft is attacking."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'For Emancipation Angel’s triggered ability, the permanent to return is chosen as the ability resolves. No player may take actions between the time you choose the permanent and the time it’s returned to its owner’s hand.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If Emancipation Angel is still on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves, you may return Emancipation Angel itself.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'If Fiend Hunter leaves the battlefield before its first ability has resolved, its second ability will trigger and do nothing. Then its first ability will resolve and exile the target creature indefinitely. This is different from abilities on other cards that exile a permanent "until" something happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if you lose the game, the creature exiled with Fiend Hunter remains exiled indefinitely. This is also different from abilities on other cards that exile a permanent "until" something happens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Once the exiled creature returns, it\'s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s hand has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Multiple instances of first strike on the same creature are redundant.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If Driver of the Dead dies at the same time as a creature with mana value 2 or less, you can target that card and return it to the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If a creature card with mana value 2 or less becomes a copy of Driver of the Dead and dies, it can be the target of its own ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You choose the target for Dread Return before paying any of its costs, so it\'s not possible to cast it using flashback and bring back one of the creatures you sacrifice."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If another nontoken creature dies at the same time as Harvester of Souls, its ability triggers for that creature.'}]"]
foreign_names: ["[{'name': 'その場しのぎのやっかいもの', 'text': 'その場しのぎのやっかいものを唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カードを１枚追放する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ホラー', 'flavor': '「人々が何故こんな使えそうなものを捨てるのか、いつも理解に苦しむな。」\\n――屍錬金術師、ルーデヴィック', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409701&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ea5b3c5-7249-45cf-a52b-5f974cc78e93', 'multiverseId': 409701}, 'multiverseid': 409701}]", "[{'name': 'とがった三つ叉', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは先制攻撃を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが人間であるかぎり、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備{1}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': '誰もが祝福された銀の剣を持っているわけではない。誰もがそれを必要としているわけでもないが。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409688&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de82b840-9217-4a88-99ee-7c56039f1b75', 'multiverseId': 409688}, 'multiverseid': 409688}]", "[{'name': 'グリフの先兵', 'text': '飛行\\nグリフの先兵が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士', 'flavor': '「グールが扉を叩き壊したんです。でもグリフの呼び声が聞こえてきて、それで私らは救われたと分かりました。」\\n――ハンウィアーの商店主、エッカ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409681&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '234515ab-cc59-42ab-9e6a-0a36faeef80e', 'multiverseId': 409681}, 'multiverseid': 409681}]", "[{'name': 'グールの解体人', 'text': '不死（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていなかったなら、これを＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': '精神がないから、死を恐れない。魂がないから、平気で殺す。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409709&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9372330d-6a09-4421-a33c-fed22adb7795', 'multiverseId': 409709}, 'multiverseid': 409709}]", "[{'name': 'グール起こし', 'text': 'グール起こしが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からゾンビ・カードを１枚無作為に選んであなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': '「来たれ。同胞を連れてこい。今宵、お前は生者の肉を楽しむであろう。」\\n――ネファリアのグール呼び、ジャダー', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409714&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9ad6dc9-0029-42f2-b6c5-e6939c96e20e', 'multiverseId': 409714}, 'multiverseid': 409714}]", "[{'name': 'スレイベンの異端者', 'text': '{T}：いずれかの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「死者を焼くことを非難するならさせておけばいい。グール呼びどもに、これ以上奴らの狂気の燃料を与える訳にはいかん。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409676&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e37bc56-62e9-490e-9694-1ccaec5e2c91', 'multiverseId': 409676}, 'multiverseid': 409676}]", "[{'name': 'ネファリアの密輸人', 'text': '{3}{U}, {T}：あなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。その後そのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者', 'flavor': '「うちの御者連中は信頼できるぜ。俺がこの手で舌を抜いたからな。他に知りたいことは？」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409683&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b74729f-e896-4fa0-b785-4a04938edec6', 'multiverseId': 409683}, 'multiverseid': 409683}]", "[{'name': 'ファルケンラスの貴族', 'text': '飛行\\nファルケンラスの貴族か他のクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼', 'flavor': '「私は常々考えるのだ。私の餌食に選ばれたことで、奴らがどれだけ喜ぶべきなのかということを。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409713&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a051c01b-27ad-4101-ad63-f68b857658d6', 'multiverseId': 409713}, 'multiverseid': 409713}]", "[{'name': 'ヘイヴングルのルーン縛り', 'text': '{2}{U}, {T}, あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カードを１枚追放する：黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出し、その後あなたがコントロールする各ゾンビ・クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「死体はかくも多く、時間はかくも少ない。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409700&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8747aad-8672-4855-bd7d-f32eb88ae109', 'multiverseId': 409700}, 'multiverseid': 409700}]", "[{'name': 'ムーアランドの審問官', 'text': '{2}{W}：ターン終了時まで、ムーアランドの審問官は先制攻撃を得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '審問官が教わるのは経典と哲学、そして斧を研ぎ澄ませる業である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409672&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7114485a-b81b-4d4b-bb4f-7ab1a2397779', 'multiverseId': 409672}, 'multiverseid': 409672}]", "[{'name': '一瞬の瞬き', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。その後それをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{U}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409671&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a325636e-621c-41ab-aae4-f56be11bc108', 'multiverseId': 409671}, 'multiverseid': 409671}]", "[{'name': '上座の聖戦士', 'text': '上座の聖戦士が死亡したとき、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。そのクリーチャーが人間であるなら、代わりにそれの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '「私の一番の望みは、お前が全ての面で私を追い越し、私の名を歴史の片隅に埋もれさせてしまうことだ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409665&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd9174f5-e1ce-47b0-a0fa-57971d95d1ff', 'multiverseId': 409665}, 'multiverseid': 409665}]", "[{'name': '二人組の見張り番', 'text': '結魂（このクリーチャーか他のまだ組になっていないクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、あなたはそれらを組にしてもよい。それらのクリーチャーは、あなたがその両方をコントロールし続けるかぎり組である。）\\n二人組の見張り番が他のクリーチャーと組になっているかぎり、両方のクリーチャーはそれぞれ「このクリーチャーが対戦相手１人にダメージを与えるたび、カードを１枚引く。」を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409685&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78653eb0-18dd-4fc0-ae23-9a73d53c182d', 'multiverseId': 409685}, 'multiverseid': 409685}]", "[{'name': '人間の脆さ', 'text': '人間・クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「私は百もの定命の血筋が栄えては滅びるのを見届けてきたわ。あと千の血筋よりも生き永らえてみせましょう。」\\n――オリヴィア・ヴォルダーレン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409717&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cba4c8e-2229-4c17-9bae-0e6e3a7069f0', 'multiverseId': 409717}, 'multiverseid': 409717}]", "[{'name': '信仰の縛め', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、それが人間であるかぎり＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。そうでないかぎり、それでは攻撃したりブロックしたりできない。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '「破壊し得ぬ物は縛られるであろう。」\\n――アヴァシンの誓約', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409658&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3ce036c-9119-47fa-9f3d-3b2cd3199c98', 'multiverseId': 409658}, 'multiverseid': 409658}]", "[{'name': '倒し霊', 'text': '飛行\\n倒し霊が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\\n昂揚 ― 各対戦相手のアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあるカードにカード・タイプが合計４種類以上含まれる場合、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409677&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cca41be8-04ec-4e1e-adc0-69ddda0f6441', 'multiverseId': 409677}, 'multiverseid': 409677}]", "[{'name': '叱責', 'text': '攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「望んでスカーブに縫い合わされた者などいません。言葉が話せるなら、自らの破滅を請うでしょう。」\\n――聖戦騎士、サリア', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409673&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '733cacdd-9d20-4a07-a5c8-4dfc0d0fc1b3', 'multiverseId': 409673}, 'multiverseid': 409673}]", "[{'name': '執拗なスカーブ', 'text': '執拗なスカーブを唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カードを１枚追放する。\\n不死（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていなかったなら、これを＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409702&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d0b9de9-2ede-41c1-bba0-6ca16aed3abd', 'multiverseId': 409702}, 'multiverseid': 409702}]", "[{'name': '塔の霊', 'text': '飛行\\n塔の霊が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、もう１枚をあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': 'ジェンリクの塔に仕えているのは、招かれざるままに入る術を求めた者達だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409686&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b87bcddb-77cc-4440-ad4e-7a89d847ebe3', 'multiverseId': 409686}, 'multiverseid': 409686}]", "[{'name': '墓所這い', 'text': '墓所這いではブロックできない。\\nあなたは、あなたがゾンビをコントロールしているかぎり、墓所這いをあなたの墓地から唱えてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': '「イニストラードのグール呼びにも才能はあるけど、本当の力を持った者が生み出すものを見せてやるよ。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409715&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85599c51-a58e-4aec-94b2-a8966bc24aee', 'multiverseId': 409715}, 'multiverseid': 409715}]", "[{'name': '夜の犠牲', 'text': '吸血鬼でも狼男でもゾンビでもないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「血に触っては駄目。まだよ。処刑者の最後の信仰の危機というのを見たいのよ。」\\n――オリヴィア・ヴォルダーレン', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409723&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '110c2b20-63c5-423b-9806-3c8cb56c05c8', 'multiverseId': 409723}, 'multiverseid': 409723}]", "[{'name': '大聖堂の聖別者', 'text': '大聖堂の聖別者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは３点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック', 'flavor': '「悪はほどなく征伐されるでしょう。イニストラードに今もっとも必要なのは癒しです。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409659&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55ac78a2-5227-4b96-8eb8-3d18a2bc7d40', 'multiverseId': 409659}, 'multiverseid': 409659}]", "[{'name': '奇妙な幕間', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを対象とし、それらを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '存在と忘却の境界は、人々が思うより僅かである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409664&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae8fd448-e4a4-4059-b146-4d57c7a677b7', 'multiverseId': 409664}, 'multiverseid': 409664}]", "[{'name': '安らかに旅立つ者', 'text': '飛行\\n安らかに旅立つ者があなたの墓地にあるかぎり、あなたがコントロールする各人間・クリーチャーは、＋１/＋１カウンターが追加で１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': '「我らの祖先を忘れてはならぬ。彼らは我々を忘れてはおらぬ。」\\n――月皇ミケウス', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409662&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eee81861-4da4-4501-8e7d-34fcfdb2a689', 'multiverseId': 409662}, 'multiverseid': 409662}]", "[{'name': '宿命の旅人', 'text': '宿命の旅人が死亡したとき、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '彼は目的地に着くまで決して休まないことを誓った。それがどれだけ正しいことなのかはわかっていない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409663&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1973d5dc-b30c-473b-9ead-8f946ca6bbe9', 'multiverseId': 409663}, 'multiverseid': 409663}]", "[{'name': '屑肌のドレイク', 'text': '飛行\\n屑肌のドレイクは飛行を持つクリーチャーのみをブロックできる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ドレイク', 'flavor': '「聖戦士達が下で私のスカーブを殺したようだ。その剣がどれほどの高さまで届くか見てやろうじゃないか。」\\n――屍錬金術師、ルーデヴィック', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409703&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10a37d90-7698-478a-b76e-45a2c3d32f59', 'multiverseId': 409703}, 'multiverseid': 409703}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409691&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cbce3b0a-93ce-4462-bf61-e86445ad4659', 'multiverseId': 409691}, 'multiverseid': 409691}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409692&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b00fc9b-216d-4b16-82b2-8d66dc0d3781', 'multiverseId': 409692}, 'multiverseid': 409692}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409693&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d8b18dd-18e4-4dda-8920-166fd9993227', 'multiverseId': 409693}, 'multiverseid': 409693}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409727&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea1b02fd-e983-4419-b2a2-3d8a684c860a', 'multiverseId': 409727}, 'multiverseid': 409727}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409728&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac2f8286-d3b4-4e26-9b3a-5ae210b3b94f', 'multiverseId': 409728}, 'multiverseid': 409728}]", "[{'name': '島', 'type': '基本土地 — 島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409729&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb70a5fe-279e-455c-bdef-81cad03afb38', 'multiverseId': 409729}, 'multiverseid': 409729}]", "[{'name': '州民の声', 'text': '飛行\\n州民の声が戦場に出たとき、白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '彼女の角笛はイニストラード中に響き、正しき者達の心を奮い立たせた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409679&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecda103a-062b-45ba-8ea9-81a1c3523ea9', 'multiverseId': 409679}, 'multiverseid': 409679}]", "[{'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409694&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bdaeb24d-6f34-44a9-bf20-a3b84e7247fd', 'multiverseId': 409694}, 'multiverseid': 409694}]", "[{'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409695&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7075a372-4750-4869-bf98-536630dc2f55', 'multiverseId': 409695}, 'multiverseid': 409695}]", "[{'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409696&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf808068-2df3-4527-8184-311ca390c640', 'multiverseId': 409696}, 'multiverseid': 409696}]", "[{'name': '平穏な入り江', 'text': '平穏な入り江はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n平穏な入り江が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{W}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409690&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49cf8825-1330-4c11-86f7-04e9e836abb2', 'multiverseId': 409690}, 'multiverseid': 409690}]", "[{'name': '幽体の門護衛', 'text': '結魂（このクリーチャーか他のまだ組になっていないクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、あなたはそれらを組にしてもよい。それらのクリーチャーは、あなたがその両方をコントロールし続けるかぎり組である。）\\n幽体の門護衛が他のクリーチャーと組になっているかぎり、両方のクリーチャーは警戒を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット・兵士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409675&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c647a2f2-c689-4114-bc64-2963f6c5c1f9', 'multiverseId': 409675}, 'multiverseid': 409675}]", "[{'name': '忌まわしきものの処刑者', 'text': '忌まわしきものの処刑者が戦場に出たとき、吸血鬼１体か狼男１体かゾンビ１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '彼の獲物の首の数々は見たくないだろう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409674&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '626382ab-ab76-48ca-be78-0dc66911f2ee', 'multiverseId': 409674}, 'multiverseid': 409674}]", "[{'name': '息せぬ群れ', 'text': '息せぬ群れは、あなたがコントロールする他のゾンビ１体およびあなたの墓地にあるゾンビ・カード１枚につき、＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n息せぬ群れにダメージが与えられるなら、そのダメージを軽減し、それの上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409722&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae132e51-5434-4970-9704-86c5b37a220c', 'multiverseId': 409722}, 'multiverseid': 409722}]", "[{'name': '悪鬼の狩人', 'text': '悪鬼の狩人が戦場に出たとき、他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。\\n悪鬼の狩人が戦場を離れたとき、その追放されたカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409667&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aed6fe2c-a212-491a-870d-f55968ba6d85', 'multiverseId': 409667}, 'multiverseid': 409667}]", "[{'name': '戦墓のグール', 'text': '戦墓のグールはタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': '「少なくとも、こいつはまだ腕も脚もある。まあ、脚の大部分だがな。」\\n――ネファリアのグール呼び、エンスロウ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409710&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b44f06a7-395a-4dd8-9403-fc66083f664f', 'multiverseId': 409710}, 'multiverseid': 409710}]", "[{'name': '戦墓の隊長', 'text': '接死\\nあなたがコントロールする他のゾンビ・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたのコントロールする他のゾンビが１体死亡するたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・兵士', 'flavor': '精神は腐り果ててからずいぶんと経つが、恐るべき剣とその腕前は変わっていない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409724&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd98efb9b-35b2-4c01-8836-a421d7d0197c', 'multiverseId': 409724}, 'multiverseid': 409724}]", "[{'name': '戦慄の復活', 'text': 'あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\\nフラッシュバック ― クリーチャーを３体生け贄に捧げる。（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '戻りたいという気持ちが、生きていたいという気持ちを上回ることがある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409711&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '013797f4-3a9d-4a5d-a79a-7acdb66ae952', 'multiverseId': 409711}, 'multiverseid': 409711}]", "[{'name': '抗えない抑止', 'text': '土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。あなたがゾンビをコントロールしているなら、その後そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚捨てる。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '「おもてなしは、これくらいに。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409698&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e87467f7-e3a9-4a88-8acb-40385ac6756a', 'multiverseId': 409698}, 'multiverseid': 409698}]", "[{'name': '教区の勇者', 'text': '他の人間が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、教区の勇者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士', 'flavor': '「私はこの町の靴屋や皮職人や愚か者のために戦う――そして、彼らも私のために戦ってくれる。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409660&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa3fe905-6cba-4b75-9ba9-1bac4f0fb1e7', 'multiverseId': 409660}, 'multiverseid': 409660}]", "[{'name': '村の鐘鳴らし', 'text': '瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\n村の鐘鳴らしが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールするすべてのクリーチャーをアンタップする。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト', 'flavor': '「僧よ、狩人よ、処刑者よ――武器を取れ！敵が近づいているぞ！」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409678&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91623c83-8993-47c1-a89b-50e5dbdcfb85', 'multiverseId': 409678}, 'multiverseid': 409678}]", "[{'name': '歯牙収集家', 'text': '歯牙収集家が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－１の修整を受ける。\\n昂揚 ― 各対戦相手のアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあるカードにカード・タイプが合計４種類以上含まれる場合、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－１の修整を受ける。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409720&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c294211-e044-4c48-8d1d-16bf24e985be', 'multiverseId': 409720}, 'multiverseid': 409720}]", "[{'name': '死体の運び屋', 'text': '死体の運び屋が死亡したとき、あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが２以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼', 'flavor': '聖戦士に屋敷を焼かれ、先祖代々の餌場を追われた吸血鬼の一部は、死体売買に身をやつすこととなった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409712&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29690411-3c41-46a6-896b-6d3e35b42cb0', 'multiverseId': 409712}, 'multiverseid': 409712}]", "[{'name': '沼', 'type': '基本土地 — 沼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409730&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '505c531c-cae3-460f-b0d1-817a8c5c3ea2', 'multiverseId': 409730}, 'multiverseid': 409730}]", "[{'name': '沼', 'type': '基本土地 — 沼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409731&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '079c3b8b-ca54-458e-a759-c7ee61113602', 'multiverseId': 409731}, 'multiverseid': 409731}]", "[{'name': '沼', 'type': '基本土地 — 沼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409732&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b108c64-cb79-441a-8702-af0e097456f3', 'multiverseId': 409732}, 'multiverseid': 409732}]", "[{'name': '熟読', 'text': 'カードを３枚引き、土地を最大２つアンタップし、その後カードを１枚捨てる。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「『マルコフ荘園の運命がこれらの謎の石と関係しているのは間違いない……』どうやらタミヨウは何かを知っていたようだ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409684&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '35687fbf-1061-4f84-9947-46b34d6a2112', 'multiverseId': 409684}, 'multiverseid': 409684}]", "[{'name': '熾天使の聖域', 'text': '熾天使の聖域が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n天使が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{C}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409689&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '084a315e-e2d1-4028-95dd-947eaf349580', 'multiverseId': 409689}, 'multiverseid': 409689}]", "[{'name': '町民の結集', 'text': '白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。\\n窮地 ― あなたのライフが５点以下であるなら、代わりにそれらのトークンを５体戦場に出す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '彼らが失った仲間への想いの中には、街を守るために必要な力がある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409668&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f161cd8-e60e-4df0-94af-fb0b53ebfdeb', 'multiverseId': 409668}, 'multiverseid': 409668}]", "[{'name': '礼拝堂の霊', 'text': '飛行', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット', 'flavor': '死はそれを後悔の鎖で縛る。それは永遠に贖罪を求め続け、善行一つが鎖の輪を一つ取り除く。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409661&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25905ced-a306-4a6d-a38e-adede011d898', 'multiverseId': 409661}, 'multiverseid': 409661}]", "[{'name': '神聖を汚す者のうめき', 'text': '黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。\\nフラッシュバック{5}{B}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'グールにとって、すべての村は御馳走であり、すべての災害は再会である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409718&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ab2361f-5363-43a9-8e0d-1d5eaf5a35b5', 'multiverseId': 409718}, 'multiverseid': 409718}]", "[{'name': '禁忌の錬金術', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から４枚のカードを見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\\nフラッシュバック{6}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409699&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22657b6b-c012-441b-93bf-5334a354c439', 'multiverseId': 409699}, 'multiverseid': 409699}]", "[{'name': '精神壊しの悪魔', 'text': '飛行、トランプル\\n精神壊しの悪魔が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から４枚のカードをあなたの墓地に置く。\\n昂揚 ― あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあるカードにカード・タイプが合計４種類以上含まれるのでないかぎり、あなたは４点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409697&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c39d4717-545a-457b-8e65-1f32df34546c', 'multiverseId': 409697}, 'multiverseid': 409697}]", "[{'name': '継ぎ当ての翼', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは飛行を持つ。\\n装備{1}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': '屍錬金術師にとって、あらゆる謎は知性と集めた身体の部品があれば解けるものだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409725&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ffd1bac-55a7-4960-a7c1-30707263377c', 'multiverseId': 409725}, 'multiverseid': 409725}]", "[{'name': '縫い合わせのドレイク', 'text': '縫い合わせのドレイクを唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カードを１枚追放する。\\n飛行', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ドレイク', 'flavor': '「最高のスカーブは、その部品全部を集めたよりも強力で美しい。」\\n――縫い師、ゲラルフ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409705&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '545ecffa-5a43-4cff-acb9-c8e3614bf6d7', 'multiverseId': 409705}, 'multiverseid': 409705}]", "[{'name': '聖トラフトの霊', 'text': '呪禁（このクリーチャーは、対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n聖トラフトの霊が攻撃するたび、飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークンを１体、タップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。戦闘終了時に、そのトークンを追放する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — スピリット・クレリック', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409657&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd31cbedd-e400-4074-9238-9fbf1f3c0227', 'multiverseId': 409657}, 'multiverseid': 409657}]", "[{'name': '肉切り屋のグール', 'text': '先制攻撃\\nこのターンに肉切り屋のグールからダメージを与えられたクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、あなたはそのクリーチャーのタフネスに等しい点数のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': '死は彼の人間性を奪ったが、包丁使いの腕までは奪わなかった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409706&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b67f684-e6d4-480d-af63-bc4e61e953c5', 'multiverseId': 409706}, 'multiverseid': 409706}]", "[{'name': '肉屋の包丁', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが人間であるかぎり、それは絆魂を持つ。\\n装備{3}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': 'スレイベンに守られている外では、道具と武器の間にはほとんど違いが無い。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409687&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c30bfae0-2451-46d4-9ddd-ef07be32bf60', 'multiverseId': 409687}, 'multiverseid': 409687}]", "[{'name': '脳食願望', 'text': '対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開する。あなたはその中から点数で見たマナ・コストが４以上のカードを１枚選び、そのカードを追放する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '桃と同じで、一口目が一番美味い。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409707&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2508bdc0-491f-4e7b-be08-17bce7e725ec', 'multiverseId': 409707}, 'multiverseid': 409707}]", "[{'name': '血のやりとり', 'text': '各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、クリーチャーを２体生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '「我らは皆、イニストラードのために犠牲を払わねばならない。」\\n――ソリン・マルコフ', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409708&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9c1fa34-c4e8-4831-ade7-8d4d2c087163', 'multiverseId': 409708}, 'multiverseid': 409708}]", "[{'name': '血統の切断', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それと、そのクリーチャーと同じ名前を持つ他のすべてのクリーチャーを追放する。\\nフラッシュバック{5}{B}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409719&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4a31147-d12c-43ba-a212-66516e75dc6f', 'multiverseId': 409719}, 'multiverseid': 409719}]", "[{'name': '解放の天使', 'text': '飛行\\n解放の天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールするパーマネント１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': '「あなたは最善を尽くしました。もうお休みになって結構です。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409666&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f950cde3-11d3-4b58-adf8-be7ddbe0597f', 'multiverseId': 409666}, 'multiverseid': 409666}]", "[{'name': '金切り声のスカーブ', 'text': '金切り声のスカーブが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードをあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ', 'flavor': 'その叫び声は、お前が正気を失う音だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409704&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8789e7b-7539-4504-9e66-f08dc863cdcd', 'multiverseId': 409704}, 'multiverseid': 409704}]", "[{'name': '陰鬱な僻地', 'text': '陰鬱な僻地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n陰鬱な僻地が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}か{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409726&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a455458-57a4-4e8a-a2ca-3ae18c85fe03', 'multiverseId': 409726}, 'multiverseid': 409726}]", "[{'name': '霧の海の船長', 'text': '他の人間が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、霧の海の船長をアンタップする。\\n{1}{U}, {T}：パーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれをタップまたはアンタップしてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': '「俺は単なる船長じゃねえ。北風は俺の仲間。潮流は俺の航海士なのさ。」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409680&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a85a81f9-09fb-45a4-b199-167fea84494b', 'multiverseId': 409680}, 'multiverseid': 409680}]", "[{'name': '霧鴉', 'text': '飛行\\n霧鴉が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥', 'flavor': '「鴉を見たら丘へ急げよ。あいつは幽霊潮が迫るのが分かるんだ。」\\n――ネファリアの漁師、スヴェド', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409682&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4bee7a2-bf37-4cd4-97a7-56de087850a0', 'multiverseId': 409682}, 'multiverseid': 409682}]", "[{'name': '飢えへの貢ぎ物', 'text': '対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。あなたはそのクリーチャーのタフネスに等しい点数のライフを得る。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'マレーラは喜んでいた。その舞踏会には、彼女の娘への求婚者が数多く集まり、その中にはあの美形のよそ者もいた。二人はどこに行ってしまったのだろうか……。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409721&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b33dceaa-e4d8-4894-b9a6-1d3b24b501ee', 'multiverseId': 409721}, 'multiverseid': 409721}]", "[{'name': '高まる献身', 'text': '白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークンを５体戦場に出す。高まる献身が墓地から唱えられたなら、代わりにそれらのトークンを10体戦場に出す。\\nフラッシュバック{7}{W}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409670&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22b34370-25b9-4588-93f4-d8118030ab30', 'multiverseId': 409670}, 'multiverseid': 409670}]", "[{'name': '魂の収穫者', 'text': '接死\\n他のトークンでないクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — デーモン', 'flavor': '「彼は裁判官であり、陪審員であり、執行人だ。その全員を彼が殺したのだからな。」\\n――エルゴードのカール司教', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409716&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e46a1134-412e-4da6-a31f-cd8b69b2d207', 'multiverseId': 409716}, 'multiverseid': 409716}]", "[{'name': '黄金夜の救い手', 'text': '飛行\\n黄金夜の救い手が戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャー１体につき２点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 天使', 'flavor': 'その苦難には一節たりとも触れることなく、聖体はアヴァシンの帰還を歌いあげる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=409669&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08a89c20-4905-447f-b0e2-c1201b095857', 'multiverseId': 409669}, 'multiverseid': 409669}]"]
printings: ['10E', '2ED', '2X2', '2XM', '30A', '3ED', '40K', '4BB', '4ED', '5ED', '6ED', '7ED', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'AFC', 'AFR', 'AKH', 'AKR', 'ALA', 'ANA', 'ANB', 'ARC', 'ATH', 'AVR', 'BBD', 'BFZ', 'BRB', 'BRC', 'BRO', 'BTD', 'C13', 'C14', 'C15', 'C16', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'C20', 'CED', 'CEI', 'CHK', 'CLB', 'CLU', 'CM2', 'CMA', 'CMD', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'CNS', 'CST', 'DD2', 'DDC', 'DDD', 'DDE', 'DDF', 'DDG', 'DDH', 'DDI', 'DDJ', 'DDK', 'DDL', 'DDM', 'DDN', 'DDO', 'DDP', 'DDQ', 'DDR', 'DDS', 'DDT', 'DDU', 'DKA', 'DKM', 'DMR', 'DMU', 'DOM', 'DPA', 'DTK', 'DVD', 'E01', 'EA2', 'ELD', 'EMA', 'F12', 'FBB', 'FRF', 'G17', 'GK1', 'GK2', 'GN2', 'GN3', 'GNT', 'GRN', 'GS1', 'GVL', 'H09', 'HA3', 'HBG', 'HOP', 'HOU', 'ICE', 'IKO', 'IMA', 'INV', 'ISD', 'ITP', 'J14', 'J21', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JVC', 'KHC', 'KHM', 'KLD', 'KLR', 'KTK', 'LCC', 'LCI', 'LEA', 'LEB', 'LRW', 'LTC', 'LTR', 'M10', 'M11', 'M12', 'M13', 'M14', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'MBS', 'MD1', 'ME1', 'ME3', 'MH2', 'MH3', 'MIC', 'MID', 'MIR', 'MKM', 'MM3', 'MMQ', 'MOC', 'MOM', 'MRD', 'NCC', 'NEO', 'NPH', 'ODY', 'OLEP', 'ONC', 'ONE', 'ONS', 'ORI', 'OTJ', 'P02', 'P23', 'P30A', 'PAL00', 'PAL01', 'PAL02', 'PAL03', 'PAL04', 'PAL05', 'PAL06', 'PAL99', 'PALP', 'PANA', 'PARL', 'PC2', 'PCA', 'PD3', 'PDGM', 'PDKA', 'PELP', 'PF19', 'PF20', 'PGPX', 'PGRU', 'PHUK', 'PIP', 'PISD', 'PLST', 'PMPS', 'PMPS06', 'PMPS07', 'PMPS08', 'PMPS09', 'PMPS10', 'PMPS11', 'POR', 'PPP1', 'PRM', 'PRW2', 'PRWK', 'PS11', 'PSAL', 'PSOI', 'PSS2', 'PSS3', 'PSS4', 'PTC', 'PTK', 'PW12', 'PZ2', 'RAV', 'REX', 'RIX', 'RNA', 'ROE', 'RQS', 'RTR', 'S99', 'SCD', 'SHM', 'SIR', 'SIS', 'SLD', 'SNC', 'SOI', 'SOM', 'STX', 'SUM', 'TD0', 'TD2', 'THB', 'THS', 'TMP', 'TPR', 'TSP', 'TSR', 'UGL', 'UMA', 'UND', 'UNF', 'UNH', 'USG', 'UST', 'VOC', 'VOW', 'WAR', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WC02', 'WC03', 'WC04', 'WC97', 'WC98', 'WC99', 'WHO', 'WMC', 'WOE', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ['As an additional cost to cast Makeshift Mauler, exile a creature card from your graveyard.', "As an additional cost to cast Relentless Skaabs, exile a creature card from your graveyard.\\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'As an additional cost to cast Stitched Drake, exile a creature card from your graveyard.\\nFlying', 'B', 'Deathtouch\\nOther Zombie creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever another Zombie you control dies, target opponent loses 1 life.', 'Deathtouch\\nWhenever another nontoken creature dies, you may draw a card.', 'Destroy target Human creature.', 'Destroy target attacking creature.', 'Destroy target non-Vampire, non-Werewolf, non-Zombie creature.', 'Diregraf Ghoul enters the battlefield tapped.', 'Dismal Backwater enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Dismal Backwater enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B} to your mana pool.', 'Draw three cards, untap up to two lands, then discard a card.', 'Each player sacrifices two creatures.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 as long as it's a Human. Otherwise, it can't attack or block.", 'Equipped creature gets +3/+0.\\nAs long as equipped creature is a Human, it has lifelink.\\nEquip {3}', 'Equipped creature has first strike.\\nAs long as equipped creature is a Human, it gets +1/+1.\\nEquip {1}', 'Equipped creature has flying.\\nEquip {1}', "Exile any number of target creatures you control. Return those cards to the battlefield under their owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Exile target creature and all other creatures with the same name as that creature.\\nFlashback {5}{B}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Exile target creature you control, then return it to the battlefield under its owner's control.\\nFlashback {3}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)", "First strike\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Abattoir Ghoul this turn dies, you gain life equal to that creature's toughness.", 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nWhen Village Bell-Ringer enters the battlefield, untap all creatures you control.', 'Flying', 'Flying, trample\\nWhen Mindwrack Demon enters the battlefield, put the top four cards of your library into your graveyard.\\nDelirium — At the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 4 life unless there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard.', 'Flying\\nAs long as Dearly Departed is in your graveyard, each Human creature you control enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Flying\\nScrapskin Drake can block only creatures with flying.', "Flying\\nWhen Emancipation Angel enters the battlefield, return a permanent you control to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nWhen Goldnight Redeemer enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life for each other creature you control.', 'Flying\\nWhen Gryff Vanguard enters the battlefield, draw a card.', "Flying\\nWhen Mist Raven enters the battlefield, return target creature to its owner's hand.", "Flying\\nWhen Topplegeist enters the battlefield, tap target creature an opponent controls.\\nDelirium — At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, tap target creature that player controls.", 'Flying\\nWhen Tower Geist enters the battlefield, look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Flying\\nWhen Voice of the Provinces enters the battlefield, put a 1/1 white Human creature token onto the battlefield.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Falkenrath Noble or another creature dies, target player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', "Gravecrawler can't block.\\nYou may cast Gravecrawler from your graveyard as long as you control a Zombie.", "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\nWhenever Geist of Saint Traft attacks, put a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying onto the battlefield tapped and attacking. Exile that token at end of combat.", 'Look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.\\nFlashback {6}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Put five 1/1 white Human creature tokens onto the battlefield. If Increasing Devotion was cast from a graveyard, put ten of those tokens onto the battlefield instead.\\nFlashback {7}{W}{W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Put two 1/1 white Human creature tokens onto the battlefield.\\nFateful hour — If you have 5 or less life, put five of those tokens onto the battlefield instead.', 'Put two 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens onto the battlefield.\\nFlashback {5}{B}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nFlashback—\\nSacrifice three creatures. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand. Then that player discards a card if you control a Zombie.", 'Soulbond (You may pair this creature with another unpaired creature when either enters the battlefield. They remain paired for as long as you control both of them.)\\nAs long as Spectral Gateguards is paired with another creature, both creatures have vigilance.', 'Soulbond (You may pair this creature with another unpaired creature when either enters the battlefield. They remain paired for as long as you control both of them.)\\nAs long as Tandem Lookout is paired with another creature, each of those creatures has "Whenever this creature deals damage to an opponent, draw a card."', 'Target opponent reveals his or her hand. You choose a card from it with converted mana cost 4 or greater and exile that card.', "Target opponent sacrifices a creature. You gain life equal to that creature's toughness.", 'Tranquil Cove enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Tranquil Cove enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U} to your mana pool.', 'U', 'Unbreathing Horde enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each other Zombie you control and each Zombie card in your graveyard.\\nIf Unbreathing Horde would be dealt damage, prevent that damage and remove a +1/+1 counter from it.', "Undying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'W', 'When Cathedral Sanctifier enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'When Doomed Traveler dies, put a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying onto the battlefield.', 'When Driver of the Dead dies, return target creature card with converted mana cost 2 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'When Elder Cathar dies, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. If that creature is a Human, put two +1/+1 counters on it instead.', "When Fiend Hunter enters the battlefield, you may exile another target creature.\\nWhen Fiend Hunter leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'When Ghoulraiser enters the battlefield, return a Zombie card at random from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Screeching Skaab enters the battlefield, put the top two cards of your library into your graveyard.', 'When Seraph Sanctuary enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\nWhenever an Angel enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {C} to your mana pool.', 'When Slayer of the Wicked enters the battlefield, you may destroy target Vampire, Werewolf, or Zombie.', "When Tooth Collector enters the battlefield, target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.\\nDelirium — At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, target creature that player controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.", 'Whenever another Human enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Champion of the Parish.', 'Whenever another Human enters the battlefield under your control, untap Captain of the Mists.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: You may tap or untap target permanent.', '{2}{U}, {T}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Put a 2/2 black Zombie creature token onto the battlefield, then put a +1/+1 counter on each Zombie creature you control.', '{2}{W}: Moorland Inquisitor gains first strike until end of turn.', '{3}{U}, {T}: Exile another target creature you control, then return that card to the battlefield under your control.', '{T}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard.']
